<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">FIELD LENS</view><view class="title">截图找玩法</view><view class="sub">选择截图，在图片上拖动，框出想要的效果。</view><view class="card"><button bindtap="choose">选择截图</button><view style="position:relative;line-height:0" wx:if="{{src}}" bindtouchstart="start" catchtouchmove="move" bindtouchend="end"><image id="picture" style="width:100%" src="{{src}}" mode="widthFix" bindload="measure"/><view wx:if="{{rect}}" style="position:absolute;border:2px solid #bcdf7b;box-sizing:border-box;{{rect}}"></view></view><button class="ghost small" bindtap="reset" wx:if="{{src}}">使用全图</button><input placeholder="补充描述，例如：合成配方" maxlength="240" bindinput="input"/><button class="ghost small" disabled="{{!enabled}}" bindtap="toggle">{{online?'在线模型 · 仅发送裁剪区域':'本地参考图与描述检索'}}</button><button bindtap="submit" disabled="{{!src||busy}}">{{busy?'比对中…':'查找相似 Mod'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{result}}" class="card"><view class="name">{{result.mode}}</view><view>{{result.observation}}</view><view class="body" wx:if="{{!result.matches.length}}">未找到足够相似的项目。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{result.matches}}" wx:key="slug"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view>{{item.reason}}</view><button data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="add">加入草稿</button></view></view></view>
